From ee64826d599e0517e7b764ed166db2ce87065eaf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kkkqkx123 <kkkqkx123@noreply.gitlab.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:02:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add library entry point for difftastic-core

Expose difftastic as a library (src/lib.rs), add [lib] section to
Cargo.toml, promote pub(crate) to pub and replace the
CARGO_BIN_NAME macro with a literal for library builds.

Co-Authored-By: AtomCode (glm5.3-flash) <noreply@atomgit.com>
